 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "By the river I saw two men stand",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 3.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "One on this bank, one on the other side",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "One asked the man in linen",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "How long until the wonders end",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A time, times, and half a time",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Till the holy people's power breaks",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The words are closed and sealed",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Until the time of the end",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I heard but did not understand",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "My lord, what will be the outcome?",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He said go your way, Daniel",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The book is sealed until the end",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A time, times, and half a time",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Till the holy people's power breaks",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The words are closed and sealed",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Until the time of the end",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Many shall be purified and white",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Refined by the fire of truth",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The wicked shall act wickedly",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "None of them will understand",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the daily sacrifice taken away",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The abomination that causes desolation",
